# Distribution policy
# -------------------
# WHEEL (pip install / python -m build --wheel):
#   [tool.setuptools.packages.find] where=["src"] → only src/pycurvelets
#   and src/napari_curvealign, plus package-data (napari.yaml, data/*.npz).
#   Test helpers, MATLAB dumps, and comparison figures never enter the wheel.
#
# SDIST (pip install --no-binary tme-quant / python -m build --sdist):
#   Source + CI-runnable tests, including the small patient_001 fixtures.
#   The developer MATLAB-parity harness and visual-regression PNGs stay
#   git-dev only (clone the repo).
#
# GIT-DEV (clone this repo):
#   Full harness: tests/matlab_parity, tests/artifacts/bdc_regression_viz,
#   and (optional, gitignored) the local patient_02 tree for tests 4-9.

graft tests
prune tests/matlab_parity
prune tests/artifacts
# Local-only patient_02 tree (gitignored; graft would otherwise pack it).
prune tests/test_for_shg_he_registration_BDcreation/new_test_datasets_tests4-5-6-7
graft doc
include Makefile
global-exclude .DS_Store
global-exclude .coverage
global-exclude *.pyc
global-exclude __pycache__
